    "reading_order": 15,
    "text": "Example 1 : A tower stands vertically on the ground. From a point on the ground,\nwhich is 15 m away from the foot of the tower, the angle of elevation of the top of the\ntower is found to be 60°. Find the height of the tower.",
    "latex": null,
